[I] Tools to manage the Chrome OS bootloader

[T] depthcharge-tools is a collection of Python tools that ease and automate
[T] interacting with depthcharge, the bootloader built into the firmware of
[T] Chrome OS boards. It builds kernel images in the format depthcharge
[T] expects (mkdepthcharge) and writes them to the right partitions
[T] (depthchargectl), allowing other distributions to boot without replacing
[T] the firmware.

[U] https://gitlab.postmarketos.org/postmarketOS/depthcharge-tools/

[A] Depthcharge-tools Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

